---
---
<section class="architecture-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">A real deployment</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">One Node.js process on an edge box.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Not an abstract three-layer marketing diagram. A concrete picture of what a node-opcua
        deployment actually looks like on the factory floor.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="arch-diagram">
      <!-- Row 1: Field devices (three concrete assets) -->
      <div class="arch-layer field-layer">
        <div class="layer-label">Shop floor</div>
        <div class="layer-items">
          <div class="arch-node device">S7-1500 PLC<br /><span class="node-sub">line A</span></div>
          <div class="arch-node device">S7-1500 PLC<br /><span class="node-sub">line B</span></div>
          <div class="arch-node device">SICK laser scanner<br /><span class="node-sub">line A</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-connector">
        <div class="connector-line"></div>
        <div class="connector-label">S7 native protocol (via node-snap7)</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Row 2: the Node.js process, the concrete node-opcua block -->
      <div class="arch-layer opcua-layer">
        <div class="layer-label">Edge box · 1 Node.js process</div>
        <div class="layer-items">
          <div class="arch-node highlight">
            <span class="node-brand">node-opcua</span>
            <span class="node-detail">OPC UA Server exposing an Euromap 77 companion-spec address space</span>
            <span class="node-detail-secondary">+ OPC UA Client subscribing to plant historian, + MQTT client to Azure IoT Hub</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-connector">
        <div class="connector-line"></div>
        <div class="connector-label">OPC UA over TLS (Basic256Sha256, SignAndEncrypt) · MQTT over TLS</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Row 3: Consumers -->
      <div class="arch-layer app-layer">
        <div class="layer-label">Upstream consumers</div>
        <div class="layer-items">
          <div class="arch-node app">Azure IoT Hub<br /><span class="node-sub">cloud analytics</span></div>
          <div class="arch-node app">Plant SCADA<br /><span class="node-sub">OPC UA client</span></div>
          <div class="arch-node app">MES<br /><span class="node-sub">TypeScript backend</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="arch-caption">
      One process. Three protocol families in and out. Full type safety across companion-spec
      structures. Async I/O all the way through. This is the shape node-opcua is designed for.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .architecture-section {
    padding: var(--space-section) 0;
    background-color: var(--bg);
  }
  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }
  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .arch-diagram {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .arch-layer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .layer-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .layer-items {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .arch-node {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-align: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .arch-node.device {
    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .arch-node.highlight {
    background-color: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }
  .node-brand {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .node-detail {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .node-detail-secondary {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    opacity: 0.7;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .node-sub {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .arch-caption {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 2rem auto 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .arch-node.app {
    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .arch-connector {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
  }
  .connector-line {
    width: 2px;
    height: 24px;
    background: var(--divider);
  }
  .connector-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .layer-items {
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .arch-node {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
    }
    .arch-node.highlight {
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
